scopecontent.p:
Newsletters: Service Employees Union (July/Aug 1995); Allied Pride Line – July, 2001
              (vol. 1, no. 4); Building Trades News (June, 2003); Union Update (Summer 2003);
              Presente! (Sept. 2005, 2006).

Photos from Local 399 Building Services division, general, beginning January 1, 1994;
              1994 Palm Sunday program; and Proposicion para el reconocimient de SEIU, Local 399 de
              la Mesa Directiva.

Envelope from Local 87 to Jono Schaffer with black and white photos, many of Jono;
              envelope from SEIU Western States Region to Jono Schaffer with two large black and
              white photos.

IBM box of about 41 disks and content printouts, including Religion, July 7, 1983;
              Political files, August 8, 1985; LA Locals (8 disks); Voters; and disks labeled
              A1-Z.
